        "response": [
          "will_not_fix"
        ],
        "detail": "podcast-mgr (index.cgi) does not call iconv() anywhere in its codebase. Confirmed by source inspection of main.c and the cflow.txt static call graph: iconv is not reachable from any execution path. The libc6-dev package is a build-host dependency only; the iconv codepath is not compiled into index.cgi."
      }
